<h3 class="ingredients-title-template--24623173763401__ss_product_ingredients_9_FmifaE">Artichoke Leaf</h3>
</div>
<div class="ingredients-text-template--24623173763401__ss_product_ingredients_9_FmifaE"><p>Artichoke Leaf extract is primarily recognized for its potent digestive and liver-supporting properties. It stimulates the production and flow of bile, a digestive fluid essential for the breakdown and absorption of fats and fat-soluble vitamins. This improved bile flow can alleviate indigestion, bloating, and other digestive discomforts, promoting smoother digestion after meals.</p></div>
</div>
