</div>
<h3 class="ingredients-title-template--24623173763401__ss_product_ingredients_9_FmifaE">Lion's Mane</h3>
</div>
<div class="ingredients-text-template--24623173763401__ss_product_ingredients_9_FmifaE"><p>Lion's Mane Mushroom is a revered functional mushroom, increasingly recognized for its neurotrophic properties. It contains compounds like hericenones and erinacines, which are believed to stimulate the production of Nerve Growth Factor (NGF) in the brain. NGF plays a crucial role in the growth, maintenance, and survival of neurons, supporting overall brain health and cognitive function.</p></div>
</div>
