</div>
<h3 class="ingredients-title-template--24623173763401__ss_product_ingredients_9_FmifaE">L-Theanine</h3>
</div>
<div class="ingredients-text-template--24623173763401__ss_product_ingredients_9_FmifaE"><p>L-Theanine, an amino acid predominantly found in green tea, is a unique addition to our Wellness Supplement due to its calming yet non-drowsy effects. It promotes relaxation by increasing alpha brain wave activity, which is associated with a state of alert relaxation, similar to what is experienced during meditation. This allows for a reduction in feelings of anxiety and nervousness without impairing cognitive function.</p></div>
</div>
