<div class="ingredients-text-template--24623173763401__ss_product_ingredients_9_FmifaE"><p>Aloe vera gel is primarily water (over 99%), making it an excellent lightweight moisturizer. It helps to hydrate the skin without leaving a greasy residue.</p></div>
