<div class="ingredients-text-template--24623173763401__ss_product_ingredients_9_FmifaE"><p>Coconut oil is rich in saturated fatty acids, particularly lauric acid, which helps to hydrate the skin deeply and prevent moisture loss. It forms a protective barrier on the skin's surface, keeping it soft and supple.</p></div>
